Remarks\par}\pard\plain \s82\li720\widctlpar\ql\adjustright \fs20\cgrid {\s17 \sa60 \sb30
This function may be called before {\b glfwInit}.\par
}}@pointer_lifetime The returned string is static and compile-time generated.\par
@thread_safety This function may be called from any thread.\par
