Warning\par}\pard\plain \s82\li720\widctlpar\ql\adjustright \fs20\cgrid {\s17 \sa60 \sb30
The contexts of any remaining windows must not be current on any other thread when this function is called.\par
}}@reentrancy This function must not be called from a callback.\par
@thread_safety This function must only be called from the main thread.\par
